{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29950","headline":"太学创置石经 · 冯涯","name":"太学创置石经","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣唐复古制，德义功无替。\n奥旨悦诗书，遗文分篆隶。\n银钩互交映，石壁靡尘翳。\n永与乾坤期，不逐日月逝。\n儒林道益广，学者心弥锐。\n从此理化成，恩光遍遐裔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯涯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}